secondaryOutcomes.description:
1. Proportion of participants experiencing treatment-related symptoms as measured by selected scales from the EORTC QLQ-C30 - higher scores are associated with greater symptom severity.
2. Change from baseline in the global health status (GHS)/QoL scale - higher score means better overall health;
3. Time to 10% deterioration in the GHS/QoL scale - higher scores mean a better outcome
